== YouTube Playlist Template ==
This template embeds YouTube playlists into wiki pages.

<div style="background-color: rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.1); padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 4px solid #ffff00; margin: 8px 0;"><strong>Limitation:</strong>Maximum playlists limited by 200</div>

== Syntax ==
<pre>
{{YtP/2
|plid=PLAYLIST_ID
|dimensions=
|alignment=
|pldesc=
|container=
|urlargs=
|autoresize=
|valignment=
}}
</pre>

== Parameters ==
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Default !! Example
|-
| plid || YouTube playlist ID (required) || ''none'' || PLxx1234ABCD
|-
| dimensions || Width and height of the player || ''default player size'' || 400x300
|-
| alignment || Horizontal alignment of the player || inline || left, right, center, inline
|-
| pldesc || Description text for the playlist || ''empty'' || My favorite songs
|-
| container || Container class for styling || ''none'' || my-playlist-container
|-
| urlargs || Additional YouTube player URL arguments || ''none'' || autoplay=1&loop=1
|-
| autoresize || Enable/disable automatic resizing || ''none'' || true, false
|-
| valignment || Vertical alignment of the player || ''default'' || top, middle, bottom
|}

== Examples ==
=== Basic Usage ===
<pre>
{{YouTubePlaylist|plid=PLxx1234ABCD}}
</pre>

=== Advanced Usage ===
<pre>
{{YtP/2
|plid=PL73S0VEJz6VwGoivkooqW0GHeZZpPXPnf
|dimensions=640x480
|alignment=center
|pldesc=[[Aoi Yuuki]]'s Covered Songs Playlist
|container=
|urlargs=autoplay=0&loop=1
|autoresize=true
|valignment=top
}}
</pre><br/>
Output:<br/>
{{YtP/2
|plid=PL73S0VEJz6VwGoivkooqW0GHeZZpPXPnf
|dimensions=640x480
|alignment=center
|pldesc=[[Aoi Yuuki]]'s Covered Songs Playlist
|container=
|urlargs=autoplay=0&loop=1
|autoresize=true
|valignment=top
}}

== Technical Limitations ==
* Maximum playlists limited by 200
* Some regions may have restricted access to YouTube content
* Some videos may not play due to YouTube's limitations on embedding sensitive content (self-harm, gruesome content, etc.)

== Notes ==
* The playlist ID can be found in the YouTube URL after "?list="
* Dimensions should be specified in pixels
* URL arguments should follow YouTube player parameters format
* Container classes must be defined in the wiki's CSS

